  "description": "A dynaset over \"SELECT ID, N, S FROM T WHERE ID = 3\", inside BeginTrans and rolled back: the property Collect read with the index Long 0, 1, 3 and -1, the strings \"N\", \"n\" and \"T.N\", Null and Empty; then, with no Edit, Collect assigned 41 for \"N\"; Edit, Collect assigned 41 for \"N\" and 42 for index 1, read both through Collect and through Fields, Update, read; Collect assigned for the unknown name \"Nope\". Asks whether the hidden Collect member exists on a recordset, its index forms and refusals, and whether a write through it equals a Field write. The fixture copy is opened read-write.",
